      "title": "Lifting Others Up",
      "description": "Sugriva was a displaced outcast who had lost everything. Hanuman didn't just use his skills to advance his own career; he connected Sugriva to Rama and helped restore him to a position of leadership. A truly great leader uses their network and talents to empower and uplift those who are struggling.",
